<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: white;
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10B981 0%, #059669 100%);
      color: white;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 40px 30px;
    }
    .content h2 {
      color: #1F2937;
      font-size: 22px;
      margin-top: 0;
    }
    .content p {
      color: #4B5563;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
    .cta-button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #10B981;
      color: white;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 20px 0;
      transition: background 0.3s;
    }
    .cta-button:hover {
      background: #059669;
    }
    .pdf-preview {
      background: #F3F4F6;
      border: 2px dashed #D1D5DB;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .pdf-icon {
      font-size: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      background: #F9FAFB;
      color: #6B7280;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .footer a {
      color: #10B981;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>📄 Your PDF is Ready!</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <h2>Hi {{userName}}!</h2>

      <p>Your plan <strong>{{planName}}</strong> has been exported to PDF and is ready for download.</p>

      <div class="pdf-preview">
        <div class="pdf-icon">📄</div>
        <p style="margin: 0; color: #6B7280;">
          <strong>{{planName}}.pdf</strong>
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #9CA3AF;">
          Ready to download
        </p>
      </div>

      <p>You can now:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>📥 Download and save it to your device</li>
        <li>🖨️ Print it for offline reference</li>
        <li>📤 Share it with your coach or trainer</li>
        <li>📱 Save it to your cloud storage</li>
      </ul>

      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="{{pdfUrl}}" class="cta-button">Download PDF →</a>
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top: 30px; color: #6B7280; font-size: 14px;">
        💡 <strong>Note:</strong> The download link will expire in 7 days. Make sure to save your PDF!
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>
        You're receiving this email because you requested a PDF export on PlanMaker.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 20px;">© 2025 PlanMaker. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
